{"id":"en_after-the-quake-i-avenged-mom","title":"After the Quake, I Avenged Mom","titleEn":"After the Quake, I Avenged Mom","description":"Trapped beneath earthquake rubble beside her dying mother, Lucy is given what her mother calls \"brown sugar water\"—in truth, her own blood. A cracked phone lets Lucy hear her father, Victor, instruct rescuers to prioritize Stella and abandon Irene, reasoning that she is \"tough as nails.\" Once Lucy is freed, Victor embraces her with theatrical warmth, yet she notices another woman's perfume on him. Whispering to her dead mother, she asks why he told the rescuers to leave Mommy behind, and Victor freezes in terror.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/after-the-quake-i-avenged-mom/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/after-the-quake-i-avenged-mom/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Family","Modern","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ci7qe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_after-the-quake-i-avenged-mom_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ci7qe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_after-the-quake-i-avenged-mom_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ci7qe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_after-the-quake-i-avenged-mom_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ci7qe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_after-the-quake-i-avenged-mom_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/emb